  "description": "Jiho’s very innocent (a virgin) — and to his horror, he applied to work for a sex toy shop! He tried to get out of it, but now he’s indebted to the Dreamcat for broken merch. (Are these toys supposed to be that fragile?!) Then with his lousy luck he accidentally breaks the cell phone of the super handsome Seonghyun, a Dreamcat regular, and he has to repay HIM now too — but with “very special treatment!” Jiho doesn't know what he's gotten himself into... but is it bad that it feels so good? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
